# Day 11 — First Rain. 15 September. Clouding over; rain from noon. The last weather
# report. The logbook's last page (in the game's own UI). The last call. Leave when ready.

call D11_AM
  day 11
  time 06:20-12:00
  kind report
DOT  Kestrel, Basin. Last weather report of the season.
DOT  I'm going to read it slowly. Humour me.
DOT  Clouding over through the morning. Wind backing southwest. Rain by noon.
DOT  Real rain, Kestrel. The first in seven weeks. That's the season.
choice
  > "Copy, Basin." -> copy
  > "Dry {dry}, wet {wet}. For the record." if obs_am set gave_readings -> read
node read
THEO Dry bulb {dry}, wet bulb {wet}. Humidity {rh}. Wind {wind}. For the record.
DOT  For the record. Copy.
node copy
DOT  No job today. Do whatever you like. Basin out.
do errand None. The season's over. Do whatever you like.

call D11_WHERE
  day 11
  time 12:30-19:00
  needs rain_on
DOT  Kestrel, Basin. Where are you right now? Describe it. I want to picture it.
branch area:tower -> tower
branch area:meadow -> meadow
branch area:tarn -> tarn
branch area:ridge -> ridge
branch area:burn -> burn
branch area:cabin -> cabin
THEO On a trail. The dust's gone dark. It smells like a whole summer all at once.
goto out
node tower
THEO In the cab. The rain on the roof sounds like somebody's tuning a hundred snare drums, all slightly wrong.
goto out
node meadow
THEO In the meadow. The grass is bending over. The creek's already louder. The fence posts look black.
goto out
node tarn
THEO At the tarn. The water's gone from a mirror to a dish of pins. The far shore's gone grey.
goto out
node ridge
THEO On the ridge. Up in it. The cloud's on top of me. I can't see the tower. I can hear the rain on the scree, a long way down.
goto out
node burn
THEO In the burn. The snags are black now, not silver. The fireweed's all seed, and it's soaking.
goto out
node cabin
THEO On the cabin porch. The chimes are going. The tin roof's doing all the talking.
node out
DOT  ...Thank you. I can see it. Basin out.

call D11_LAST
  day 11
  time 19:30-26:00
DOT  Basin to Kestrel.
THEO Basin, Kestrel. Go ahead.
DOT  Last call of the season. There's no Basin next year, so I'll just say it plain.
DOT  It was good, having a voice on four.
choice
  > "Tell Ruth to keep the piano." if offered_tuning -> piano
  > "Go and see your sister, Dot." -> sister
  > "Thank you, Basin." -> thanks
  > [say nothing] -> quiet
node piano
THEO Tell Ruth to keep the piano. I'm coming to tune it.
DOT  ...I'll tell her. She'll want to know who you are.
THEO Tell her I'm the lookout.
goto out
node sister
THEO Go and see your sister, Dot.
DOT  ...Augie said that.
THEO Augie was right about most things. Except the stair.
goto out
node thanks
THEO Thank you, Basin.
DOT  Thank you, Kestrel.
goto out
node quiet
DOT  ...I'll take that as a maybe.
node out
set season_over
do season_over
DOT  Basin, clear.
do music rain
